      "published": "2026-07-25T20:42:35Z",
      "bullets": [
        "Leverage context caching and precise system prompt boundaries to drastically reduce API latency and token costs during high-volume inference.",
        "Use explicit XML tags and JSON schemas within context windows to reliably guide complex tool-use and multi-step agentic workflows.",
        "Optimize long-context recall by balancing structured chunk retrieval with prompt pruning to prevent attention degradation in extended model contexts."
      ]
    },
