      "bullets": [
        "Use the POSIX shell colon built-in with parameter expansion like : \"${VAR:=default}\" to safely set default variables without executing output.",
        "Truncate files without external utilities via : > file.log, or create lightweight infinite loops using while :; do.",
        "Leverage : as a standardized, zero-overhead no-op placeholder in empty conditional blocks while ensuring an exit code of 0."
      ]
